OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to shut recycling centre
OL,4,Adropped after U-turn
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to shut a recycling centre to
OL,7,Fsave #60,000 have been dropped after
OL,8,Fcritics complained it could lead to
OL,9,Fmore fly-tipping.
OL,11,FDocking Recycling Centre had been
OL,12,Fearmarked to close next year as part of
OL,13,Fa raft of cuts and savings proposed by
OL,14,FNorfolk County Council's Reform UK
OL,15,Fleadership.
OL,17,FBut at a meeting where councillors
OL,18,Fagreed to pursue other measures to save
OL,19,F#32m, the closure was dropped after
OL,20,Fcabinet members voted for an amendment.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
