OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to shut recycling centre
OL,4,Adropped after U-turn
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council is continuing with
OL,7,Fproposals to reduce hazardous waste
OL,8,Fevents to save #200,000, which critics
OL,9,Fwarn will make disposal of items like
OL,10,Fpaint harder and could lead to them
OL,11,Fbeing "dumped" illegally.
